      "right": "275px",
      "text": "<i data-commentator=\"Shiltei HaGiborim\" data-label=\"ג\" data-order=\"3\"></i>שנסרחה אין צריך לבער: <span class=\"bavli-ref\" data-bavli-ref=\"(דף מו.)\" data-bavli-daf=\"46a\" data-bavli-index=\"0\"></span>בצק <i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Leavened and Unleavened Bread\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>החרש אם יש",
